531 0 obj
<</ActualText(V. Solution Overview)/K 0/P 549 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
532 0 obj
<</ActualText(Multiplayer Workspace, Context Layer & Collaborative Threads: Replaces isolated, single-player AI chat boxes with a shared team canvas. Human operators and specialized AI agents converse, triage tasks, and monitor progress together in real-time, unified t\
hreads. Ingests teams data into a shared vector memory so both human operators and AI agents have real-time, synchronized context \(eliminating repetitive prompting\).\nAutonomous Worker Engine: Agents plan and execute multi-step tasks dynamically, adapti\
ng to errors until they hit a predefined governance boundary.\nInvisible Multi-Approval Layer \(Solana Multisig\): Enforces programmatic spending and action thresholds. High-stakes actions pause execution and require human co-approvers to sign off using n\
ative device biometrics \(FaceID/TouchID\).)/K 1/P 550 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
533 0 obj
<</ActualText(VI. Core Values)/K 2/P 551 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
534 0 obj
<</ActualText(¡ Operational Velocity)/K 3/P 552 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
535 0 obj
<</ActualText( Zero-Friction Collaboration)/K 4/P 553 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
536 0 obj
<</ActualText(Reclaims hours of works per members by automating high-stakes task loops and eliminating manual copy-pasting across external portals. Translates AI capabilities directly into measurable ROI.)/K 5/P 554 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
537 0 obj
<</ActualText(Replaces isolated single-player AI threads with a shared team workspace. Eliminates Web3 friction by authorizing actions via 1-click FaceID/TouchID passkeys instead of manual wallet management.)/K 6/P 555 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
538 0 obj
<</ActualText(– Verifiable Trust)/K 7/P 556 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
539 0 obj
<</ActualText(Every agent proposal and human biometric sign-off produces an immutable, tamper-proof on-chain record. Provides complete operational transparency and audit readiness for FinOps teams.)/K 8/P 557 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
540 0 obj
<</ActualText(VII. How It Works)/K 9/P 558 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
541 0 obj
<</ActualText(á Out-of-the-Box Guardrails and Multisig Layer)/K 10/P 559 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
542 0 obj
<</ActualText(AI agents are restricted strictly to proposers, keeping financial and operational execution under groups of human control.)/K 11/P 560 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
543 0 obj
<</ActualText(1. Zero-Crypto Onboarding: The admin logs in using native WebAuthn passkeys \(FaceID/TouchID or social SSO\). A non-custodial smart account is automatically provisioned in the background.\n2. Context Ingestion: Integrates workspace data sources \(Notion, \
Slack, GitHub\) into vector memory with 1-click, giving agents real-time operational context.\n3. Policy Governance: The team configures spending and action rules \(e.g., actions under $100 auto-approve; transactions over $100 require a 2-of-3 team quorum\
\).\n4. The Multiplayer Thread \(The UI Layer\): Human operators initiate or monitor tasks in a real-time, shared chat UI. Specialized AI agents \(e.g., Finance Agent, Legal Agent\) automatically join the thread to collaborate, provide updates, and commun\
icate transparently alongside teammates.\n5. Autonomous Background Loop: Triggered from the thread, the AI worker runs multi-step background tasks, dynamically planning and executing non-restricted operational actions.\n6. Restricted Action Proposal: Upon\
 reaching a high-stakes task \(e.g., a $1,250 vendor payout\), the AI agent acts purely as a proposer and submits a draft to the Squads V4 multisig.\n7. Execution Pause & Broadcast: The smart contract automatically pauses execution and triggers a multi-ap\
proval notification directly inside the Onforce shared thread and Slack.\n8. Approval & Biometric Signing: Designated team co-approvers review the agent's reasoning in the thread and approve the transaction with a 1-click device biometric prompt \(FaceID/\
TouchID\), generating a secure signature without managing private keys.)/K 12/P 561 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
544 0 obj
<</ActualText(VIII. Solana Infrastructure: The Invisible Security Engine)/K 13/P 562 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
545 0 obj
<</ActualText(Programmatic Team Consensus \(Squads V4\): Agents act purely as proposers on a team multisig vault, holding zero direct authority over funds or critical API keys.\nSub-Second Execution: Solanas 400ms block times ensure approved tasks settle without human\
-perceptible lag.\nNegligible Cost Overhead: Transaction fees of ~$0.00025 allow high-frequency automated agent operations without budget bloat.\nImmutable Audit Trail: Every agent proposal, human signature, and task execution produces a permanent, tamper\
-proof record for business compliance.)/K 14/P 546 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj
546 0 obj
<</K 545 0 R/P 547 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/P>>
endobj
